{"seq":1,"slug":"types-storage","title":"类型与存储布局","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/solidity-smart-contracts/language/types-storage","wordCount":1252,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"类型与存储布局\">类型与存储布局</h1><p>Solidity 的类型系统表面上像任何静态语言，但它真正的难点不在「有哪些类型」，而在「每个类型如何被塞进 EVM 那一排排 256 位的存储槽」。变量的声明顺序、类型的位宽、是否引用——这些都直接决定一份合约要花多少 gas。本节是整个 hub 里讲存储布局最深的地方，后面的<a href=\"../security/gas-optimization\">gas 优化</a>与<a href=\"../practice/upgradeable-contracts\">可升级合约</a>都建立在这里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Solidity 的类型分两大阵营：值类型（赋值即拷贝）与引用类型（赋值传引用或拷贝取决于数据位置）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    T[Solidity 类型] --&gt; V[值类型 value]&#10;    T --&gt; R[引用类型 reference]&#10;    V --&gt; V1[bool · 整数 uint/int&lt;br/&gt;address · bytesN&lt;br/&gt;enum · 定长]&#10;    R --&gt; R1[动态数组 · 定长数组]&#10;    R --&gt; R2[struct 结构体]&#10;    R --&gt; R3[mapping 映射]&#10;    R1 --&gt; LOC[需指定数据位置&lt;br/&gt;storage/memory/calldata]&#10;    R2 --&gt; LOC\">flowchart TD\n    T[Solidity 类型] --&gt; V[值类型 value]\n    T --&gt; R[引用类型 reference]\n    V --&gt; V1[bool · 整数 uint/int&lt;br/&gt;address · bytesN&lt;br/&gt;enum · 定长]\n    R --&gt; R1[动态数组 · 定长数组]\n    R --&gt; R2[struct 结构体]\n    R --&gt; R3[mapping 映射]\n    R1 --&gt; LOC[需指定数据位置&lt;br/&gt;storage/memory/calldata]\n    R2 --&gt; LOC</pre><p>下表给出常见类型的关键属性，注意「占用槽」一列是 gas 直觉的来源。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>字节宽</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>存储特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>bool</code></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>false</td>\n<td>可与其他小变量打包进一槽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>uint256</code></td>\n<td>32</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>独占一整槽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>uint8</code></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>可打包；单独使用反而可能更贵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>address</code></td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>0x0</td>\n<td>可与 <code>uint96</code> 等打包凑满 32 字节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>bytes32</code></td>\n<td>32</td>\n<td>全 0</td>\n<td>独占一槽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>mapping</code></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>仅占一个「锚」槽，值散列分布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态数组</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>空</td>\n<td>锚槽存长度，元素另算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"存储槽-256-位的格子\">存储槽：256 位的格子</h2><p>EVM 的存储是一个从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>256</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{256}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">256</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个槽到 256 位值的键值映射。Solidity 把状态变量按<strong>声明顺序</strong>从槽 0 开始依次摆放。这里有一条省钱的核心规则——<strong>变量打包（packing）</strong>：连续声明的、加起来不超过 32 字节的多个小变量会被塞进同一个槽。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"solidity\" data-code=\"contract Packed {&#10;    uint128 a;   // 槽 0 低 16 字节&#10;    uint128 b;   // 槽 0 高 16 字节  —— a、b 共享槽 0&#10;    uint256 c;   // 槽 1（放不下，另起一槽）&#10;    uint8 d;     // 槽 2&#10;    address e;   // 槽 2（1 + 20 = 21 字节，仍放得下）&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>contract Packed {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    uint128 a;   // 槽 0 低 16 字节</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    uint128 b;   // 槽 0 高 16 字节  —— a、b 共享槽 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    uint256 c;   // 槽 1（放不下，另起一槽）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    uint8 d;     // 槽 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    address e;   // 槽 2（1 + 20 = 21 字节，仍放得下）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>打包之所以重要，是因为读写一个槽的 <a href=\"evm-execution-model\">gas 成本</a>与槽里塞了几个变量无关——把两个 <code>uint128</code> 打进一槽，写它们可能只需一次 <code>SSTORE</code>。但顺序敏感：若把 <code>c</code>（占满一槽）插在 <code>a</code> 和 <code>b</code> 之间，打包就被打断，平白多用一个槽。这条规则的实战细节在 <a href=\"../security/gas-optimization\">gas 优化</a>展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"mapping-与动态数组的散列布局\">mapping 与动态数组的散列布局</h2><p>引用类型的布局规则更精巧，理解它能解释很多「看不见的槽」。</p>\n<p>对于声明在槽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 的 <strong>mapping</strong>，键 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 对应的值存放在槽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>keccak256</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\">∥</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{keccak256}(h(k) \\mathbin\\Vert p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">keccak256</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\">∥</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 处——也就是说 mapping 本身只占一个占位槽，所有键值对被哈希打散到地址空间各处。这就是为什么 mapping 无法遍历（没有长度、不知道哪些键被用过）、也无法整体拷贝。</p>\n<p>对于声明在槽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 的<strong>动态数组</strong>，槽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 存数组长度，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个元素存在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>keccak256</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{keccak256}(p) + i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">keccak256</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 处（按元素大小折算）。定长数组则直接按顺序占用从声明位置起的若干连续槽。这套规则意味着：读数组第 1000 个元素和第 0 个元素一样快（直接算地址），但遍历整个动态数组的 gas 随长度线性增长，是 DoS 风险的常见来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"值语义与引用陷阱\">值语义与引用陷阱</h2><p>引用类型在不同数据位置间赋值时的行为，是新手最常踩的坑。把一个 <code>storage</code> 数组赋给一个 <code>memory</code> 变量会<strong>深拷贝</strong>（很贵）；而声明一个 <code>storage</code> 引用指向某个状态变量则是<strong>别名</strong>——通过它修改会真的改动链上状态。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"solidity\" data-code=\"struct User { uint256 balance; bool active; }&#10;mapping(address =&gt; User) users;&#10;&#10;function topUp(address u) external {&#10;    User storage acc = users[u];  // storage 引用：别名&#10;    acc.balance += 1 ether;       // 真的改了链上状态&#10;&#10;    User memory copy = users[u];  // memory：深拷贝&#10;    copy.balance = 0;             // 只改副本，链上不变&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>struct User { uint256 balance; bool active; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>mapping(address => User) users;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function topUp(address u) external {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    User storage acc = users[u];  // storage 引用：别名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    acc.balance += 1 ether;       // 真的改了链上状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    User memory copy = users[u];  // memory：深拷贝</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    copy.balance = 0;             // 只改副本，链上不变</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>混淆这两者会导致「以为写了其实没写」或「以为只读却改了状态」的隐蔽 bug。Solidity 在编译期强制你为引用类型的局部变量写明位置，正是为了把这个昂贵且易错的区别显式化——呼应<a href=\"../foundations/why-solidity\">为什么有 Solidity</a>里「把危险显式化」的设计哲学。</p>\n<h2 id=\"整数-定点与无浮点的金钱\">整数、定点与无浮点的金钱</h2><p>Solidity 没有浮点，所有金额都用整数表示。<code>uint256</code> 能表示到约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.16</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>77</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.16 \\times 10^{77}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.16</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">77</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，足够容纳以 wei 为单位的天文数字（1 ether = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>18</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{18}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">18</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> wei）。涉及百分比、利率、价格时，通行做法是<strong>定点约定</strong>：约定一个精度因子（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>18</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{18}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">18</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），把 1.5 存成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>18</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.5 \\times 10^{18}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">18</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，乘除时手动缩放。</p>\n<p>这里有个必须牢记的陷阱：整数除法会截断，且<strong>先乘后除</strong>才能保住精度。<code>a * b / c</code> 与 <code>a / c * b</code> 在整数下结果可能不同，后者会先丢掉小数。从 0.8.0 起算术默认带溢出检查，溢出即 <code>revert</code>，消除了旧版最大的一类<a href=\"../security/common-vulnerabilities\">漏洞</a>；需要省 gas 且能证明不会溢出时，可用 <code>unchecked { }</code> 块显式关掉检查——这又是把性能与安全的权衡显式交到开发者手里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>类型分值类型与引用类型；引用类型必须显式指定 storage/memory/calldata 位置，这是正确性而非风格问题。</li>\n<li>状态变量按声明顺序从槽 0 摆放，连续小变量会<strong>打包</strong>进同一槽——顺序敏感，是 <a href=\"../security/gas-optimization\">gas 优化</a>的核心抓手。</li>\n<li>mapping 与动态数组用 keccak256 散列布局：mapping 不可遍历，数组随机访问 O(1) 但遍历线性增长（DoS 风险）。</li>\n<li>storage 引用是别名（改它改链上），memory 是深拷贝——混淆即 bug。</li>\n<li>无浮点，金额用整数 + 定点约定；先乘后除保精度；0.8.0 起默认溢出检查，可用 <code>unchecked</code> 显式关闭。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"类型与存储布局","id":"类型与存储布局"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"存储槽：256 位的格子","id":"存储槽-256-位的格子"},{"level":2,"text":"mapping 与动态数组的散列布局","id":"mapping-与动态数组的散列布局"},{"level":2,"text":"值语义与引用陷阱","id":"值语义与引用陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"整数、定点与无浮点的金钱","id":"整数-定点与无浮点的金钱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"合约结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/solidity-smart-contracts/foundations/contract-structure"},"next":{"title":"函数与修饰器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/solidity-smart-contracts/language/functions-modifiers"}}